 no added logo, no illustration or CGI look."],"widgets_values_named":{"prompt":"Replace the keyboard in image 1 with the exact mechanical keyboard from image 2.\n\nCamera and framing must stay identical to image 1: a straight-on flat-lay studio shot, camera almost level with the keyboard and only slightly above it, no low-angle or wide-angle perspective, the board level and parallel to the frame, centered, filling about 80 percent of the frame width, on the same clean seamless light-gray background with the same soft shadow beneath it.\n\nKeep the keyboard geometry from image 2 exactly: a compact TKL 87-key board, every key row perfectly straight and parallel, uniform keycap height, spacing and tilt, a low black case with a small gold badge at the top-right corner. Keep image 2's color blocking unchanged: white alphanumeric keycaps with fine red printed legends, red accent clusters along the left edge, both right columns and the arrow cluster, red side-print characters, and the long spacebar with its printed graphic. Do not tilt, rotate, stretch or resize any key, do not add or remove keys, do not invent legends.\n\nHyper-real product photography: sculpted keycaps with visible 3D side walls, crisp bevel highlights and deep micro-contrast, fine surface texture, thin even gaps between caps, believable matte plastic with a subtle sheen, clean specular roll-off on the case edges, soft large-softbox top light with a mild gradient, a short tight contact shadow under the case and no long mirror reflection on the surface, sharp focus across the whole board, neutral white balance, ultra detailed, studio catalogue quality. No text overlay, no watermark, no added logo, no illustration or CGI look."}},{"id":11,"type":"TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus","pos":[760,320],"size":[420,168],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":6},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","shape":7,"type":"VAE","link":8},{"localized_name":"图像1","nam